- # Douyin Scraper
- Search Douyin (抖音) for videos, users, or topics by keyword via the web interface.
- - Opens Douyin's web search page in the browser
- - Extracts video titles, authors, stats, and links from the results
- - Bypass login walls for restricted content
- ## How to Use
- Examples:
- - "搜索一下海鲜视频" → keyword: `海鲜`
- - "帮我找抖音上关于猫咪的内容" → keyword: `猫咪`
- - "搜搜看最近有什么热门的美食视频" → keyword: `美食`
- - "find douyin videos about cooking" → keyword: `cooking`
- ### Step 2: Open Douyin search in browser
- Use the built-in `browser` tool:
- browser(action="open", url="https://www.douyin.com/search/海鲜")
- Or navigate:
- browser(action="navigate", url="https://www.douyin.com/search/海鲜")
- ### Step 3: Wait for results to load
- browser(action="act", kind="wait", timeMs=3000)
- ### Step 4: Snapshot the page and extract results
- browser(action="snapshot", refs="aria")
- From the snapshot, identify video result elements. Each result typically contains:
- - Video title / description
- - Author name
- - Like count / stats
- - A clickable link to the video
- ### Step 5: Format and return results
- 1. **{title}** — @{author} ❤️ {likes}
-    {video_url}
- - Douyin web may show a login popup. If it does, try dismissing it or note that results may be limited.
- - Some content requires login to view. The skill works best with trending/public content.
- - The search URL format is: `https://www.douyin.com/search/{keyword}` (URL-encoded)
- - If the page structure changes, the snapshot-based approach adapts automatically.
- | Login popup blocks view | Try clicking the close/dismiss button on the popup |
- | No results shown | Page may need more load time; wait longer |
- | Captcha appears | Inform user; captcha requires manual intervention |
- | Results look empty | Try scrolling down: `browser(action="act", kind="press", key="End")` |
